00:23:37.726 --> 00:23:41.382
- And our weaker selves
think that success in life

00:23:41.382 --> 00:23:43.287
is being happy, happy, happy.

00:23:43.287 --> 00:23:45.351
Always being in the sunshine.

00:23:45.351 --> 00:23:47.550
Always being successful.

00:23:47.550 --> 00:23:50.483
And society has sold us a bill of goods

00:23:50.483 --> 00:23:54.577
that if we're not successful
and we're not on our games

00:23:54.577 --> 00:23:56.829
and if we're not waking up happy

00:23:56.829 --> 00:23:58.730
and if we're not full of joy

00:23:58.730 --> 00:24:01.211
and if we're not feeling
all this confidence

00:24:01.211 --> 00:24:03.404
there is something that is wrong.

00:24:03.404 --> 00:24:05.146
And with deep love and respect,

00:24:05.146 --> 00:24:06.972
this could be one of the
most important things

00:24:06.972 --> 00:24:09.789
I share with you in this podcast.

00:24:09.789 --> 00:24:12.561
That is just your ego screaming.

00:24:12.561 --> 00:24:15.088
And that's why I say
flow with the seasons.

00:24:15.088 --> 00:24:19.264
A life beautifully lived
is a series of seasons.

00:24:19.264 --> 00:24:22.327
A legendary producer is not always

00:24:22.327 --> 00:24:24.527
at the top of the mountain.

00:24:24.527 --> 00:24:27.932
And so stop resisting, I encourage you,

00:24:27.932 --> 00:24:32.099
stop resisting the natural
flow of epic performance.

00:24:33.348 --> 00:24:36.931
Stop resisting the
natural seasons of life.

00:24:38.643 --> 00:24:41.134
You see, and so what happens
is that when you stop

00:24:41.134 --> 00:24:43.738
struggling and you learn,
again, it's a muscle,

00:24:43.738 --> 00:24:46.429
but you just learn to relax with life.

00:24:46.429 --> 00:24:49.540
And you simply understand part of living

00:24:49.540 --> 00:24:52.422
a legendary business
life and part of living

00:24:52.422 --> 00:24:56.458
a rare air personal life
means you're going to have

00:24:56.458 --> 00:24:59.322
seasons of so-called success in society,

00:24:59.322 --> 00:25:02.134
maybe it's making a lot of
money, being really productive,

00:25:02.134 --> 00:25:05.685
being at the top of your
game, receiving the accolades

00:25:05.685 --> 00:25:09.352
of peers, feeling you
are nailing your goals

00:25:11.102 --> 00:25:13.165
and your ambitions and your KPIs,

00:25:13.165 --> 00:25:15.818
your key performance indicators,
and you're going to have

00:25:15.818 --> 00:25:18.055
seasons where you're confused.

00:25:18.055 --> 00:25:20.856
Seasons where you feel heartbroken.

00:25:20.856 --> 00:25:23.523
Seasons where you feel depleted.

00:25:24.465 --> 00:25:25.892
Seasons where you are struggling.

00:25:25.892 --> 00:25:29.416
And the more you learn to
relax into every season,

00:25:29.416 --> 00:25:32.891
the more you will generate
this internal power

00:25:32.891 --> 00:25:35.115
which I call confidence.

00:25:35.115 --> 00:25:37.516
- Secret number two, complement others.

00:25:37.516 --> 00:25:38.971
How does it feel getting a compliment?

00:25:38.971 --> 00:25:40.005
Exactly.

00:25:40.005 --> 00:25:41.579
It feels incredible.

00:25:41.579 --> 00:25:44.556
It also feels incredible giving them.

00:25:44.556 --> 00:25:45.997
Here's the interesting
thing about compliments.

00:25:45.997 --> 00:25:48.035
When somebody gives you a compliment,

00:25:48.035 --> 00:25:51.141
you automatically like them more, right?

00:25:51.141 --> 00:25:52.626
You're like, I thought he was a,

00:25:52.626 --> 00:25:54.280
but he said I had nice shoes,

00:25:54.280 --> 00:25:55.694
he's not so bad.

00:25:55.694 --> 00:25:56.985
Follow along.

00:25:56.985 --> 00:25:59.145
The person getting the
compliment feels incredible.

00:25:59.145 --> 00:26:01.180
You feel great for making
them feel incredible

00:26:01.180 --> 00:26:02.504
and they actually like you more.

00:26:02.504 --> 00:26:05.106
The other up side to giving compliments

00:26:05.106 --> 00:26:07.206
is that it helps you
develop your people skills,

00:26:07.206 --> 00:26:10.469
leading to confidence and
increased social prowess.

00:26:10.469 --> 00:26:12.899
- Human develops in its psyche.

00:26:12.899 --> 00:26:15.088
We develop a real sense of competence

00:26:15.088 --> 00:26:18.559
or confidence coming
from a sense of integrity

00:26:18.559 --> 00:26:20.680
for ourselves, you know?

00:26:20.680 --> 00:26:22.671
Integrity is I know who I am

00:26:22.671 --> 00:26:25.243
and I am being that consistently.

00:26:25.243 --> 00:26:29.410
I know what I want and I am
chasing that consistently.

00:26:30.334 --> 00:26:33.725
Integrity being aligned with
who you are, your values,

00:26:33.725 --> 00:26:37.725
your beliefs, and your
dreams, having integrity,

00:26:39.892 --> 00:26:42.629
that gives us confidence in self, right,

00:26:42.629 --> 00:26:46.210
that our self can stand
on its own and be itself

00:26:46.210 --> 00:26:49.636
and do what it desires, that
gives us a sense of confidence,

00:26:49.636 --> 00:26:51.244
so how have you been
doing in that department?

00:26:51.244 --> 00:26:53.799
Have you been really
demonstrating who you are

00:26:53.799 --> 00:26:55.041
to the world?

00:26:55.041 --> 00:26:56.701
Have you allowed yourself to
do that, 'cause if you do that

00:26:56.701 --> 00:26:59.114
over a period of time, this
self and I would argue,

00:26:59.114 --> 00:27:02.800
the soul, senses a coherence, you know,

00:27:02.800 --> 00:27:05.561
there's a cohesive sense
of identity that comes

00:27:05.561 --> 00:27:09.908
from being consistent to
the best of who we are.

00:27:09.908 --> 00:27:11.445
Confidence comes from that.

00:27:11.445 --> 00:27:13.554
And that, too, is will.

00:27:13.554 --> 00:27:15.053
It is decision.

00:27:15.053 --> 00:27:18.482
It is a desire to want to
be a person of integrity

00:27:18.482 --> 00:27:22.064
and confidence, and that's
where it stems from.

